# The steig plank over the kalkfels_bg back wall (one-way, like steig): for
# the shaft, where a plank cell replaces a back-wall cell (one tile per cell,
# the balcony/wall_village_bg pattern). The wall shows the plank's 2 px d
# cast shadow under it. Only the left/right bits change the look.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_steig_wall
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
